<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Confirmação de Cadastro</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Poppins:300,400,700" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
        body {
          margin: 0;
          padding: 0;
          background: white;
          font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
          overflow-x: hidden;
          margin: auto;
          height: 100vh;
        }
        .email-container {
          margin: auto;
          max-width: 400px;
          background: #f7f7f7;
          padding: 75px 46px;
          border-radius: 8px;
          text-align: center;
        }
        h2 {
          color: #2F4A4D;
          font-size: 30px;
          font-weight: 400;
          line-height: 32px;
          padding-bottom: 16px;
        }
        strong {
          font-weight: 600;
        }
        p {
          font-size: 16px;
          color: #2F4A4D;
          padding-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .btn {
          display: inline-block;
          background: #00735E;
          color: #ffffff;
          padding: 14px 20px;
          font-size: 16px;
          font-weight: 600;
          border-radius: 6px;
          line-height: 22px;
          text-decoration: none;
          margin-bottom: 92px;
        }
        .logo {
          margin-top: 20px;
        }
        a {
          text-decoration: none;
          color: #FFFF !important;
        }
        img {
          height: 50px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <h2>Bem-vindo <strong><%= props.first_name %></strong>!</h2>
      <p>Para confirmar o seu cadastro e ter acesso ao aplicativo e-COO, clique no botão abaixo:</p>
      <a href="<%= props.url %>" class="btn">Confirmar cadastro</a>
      <div class="logo">
        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dxzwe3ncs/image/upload/v1743634323/Logo-Colorido_gbjn6x.png" alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

